{
  "comment": "FabricDevice lists as the agent reports them in HostSettings (bytes received plus transmitted over window_seconds since its last report, from the sysfs port counters in 4-byte words) and whether the Controller raises network.rails-underused. Busy is at least 8 MiB/s, flat under 1% of the busy sibling, window at least 30 s. The Rust agent test reads every list through the generated contract and reads the sysfs sample as the agent_sample; the Controller test projects each case onto a node.",
